  "releaseNotes": "Release Notes v6.0.0 Core Functionality :- Targets .NetStandard 2.1, .Net 9.0 and .Net 10.0\n      Library to Implement Feature Toggles to hide/show program features.\n\n      Major v6.0.0 Release Features:\n      - Full OpenFeature Specification (v1.x) Provider support, built in to the FeatureOne package under the\n        FeatureOne.OpenFeature namespace. No separate package install is required.\n      - Custom condition types can be registered with ConditionDeserializer.Register().\n      - Interoperability enhancements: Exposed FeatureStore property on Features facade for open integration.\n      - Multi-targeted for .NET Standard 2.1, .NET 9.0, and .NET 10.0.",
